<figure class="cache-figure" data-transaction-errors>
 <p class="figure-title">An error tells you less than the surviving writes</p>
 <label class="cache-field">Experiment <select data-mode aria-label="Atomic operation error"><option value="transaction">MULTI / EXEC · runtime error</option><option value="queue">MULTI / EXEC · queue-time error</option><option value="script">Lua · unhandled runtime error</option></select></label>
 <p class="figure-note">Inspection frames inside one execution. Other clients cannot read these intermediate states during EXEC or the script.</p>
 <ol class="atomic-command-strip">{[0,1,2].map(i=><li><code data-command={i}></code><span data-status={i}>waiting</span></li>)}</ol>
 <div class="cache-copy-pair"><div class="cache-copy"><small>Stored key: first</small><strong data-first>absent</strong></div><div class="cache-copy"><small>Stored key: last</small><strong data-last>absent</strong></div></div>
 <div class="cache-controls"><button data-back>Previous operation</button><button data-next>Next operation</button><button data-reset>Reset errors</button></div>
 <p class="explanation" data-explanation aria-live="polite"></p>
 <figcaption>Follow all three experiments to their end. Queue-time validation, continuing after a transaction command error, and stopping at an unhandled Lua error have different outcomes. No mode undoes a successful write that already executed.</figcaption>
</figure>
<script>
import {errorFrame} from '../../lib/caching/atomicity.mjs';
document.querySelectorAll<HTMLElement>('[data-transaction-errors]').forEach(root=>{const select=root.querySelector<HTMLSelectElement>('[data-mode]')!;let step=0;const render=()=>{const s=errorFrame(select.value,step);s.labels.forEach((v,i)=>{root.querySelector(`[data-command="${i}"]`)!.textContent=v;const status=root.querySelector<HTMLElement>(`[data-status="${i}"]`)!;status.textContent=s.statuses[i];status.closest('li')!.classList.toggle('written',s.statuses[i]==='written');status.closest('li')!.classList.toggle('failed',s.statuses[i].includes('error'));});for(const k of['first','last','explanation'])root.querySelector(`[data-${k}]`)!.textContent=k==='explanation'?s.message:s[k];root.querySelector<HTMLButtonElement>('[data-back]')!.disabled=step===0;root.querySelector<HTMLButtonElement>('[data-next]')!.disabled=step===s.max;};select.onchange=()=>{step=0;render();};root.querySelector<HTMLButtonElement>('[data-back]')!.onclick=()=>{step--;render();};root.querySelector<HTMLButtonElement>('[data-next]')!.onclick=()=>{step++;render();};root.querySelector<HTMLButtonElement>('[data-reset]')!.onclick=()=>{step=0;render();};render();});
</script>
